8A.18 To up-date Survey and Map: (1) If the survey and map has to be
amended in accordance with the registration set pursuant to Sections 7 and
8, the Land Revenue Office has to write to the concerned 19Maintenance
Survey Section; and after it has been so written, the 20Maintenance Survey
Section has to make necessary amendment to the survey and map.
