29.46 Punishment to a Person who Registers or Cultivates
Governmental or Public Land: Any person who registers or cultivates
a governmental land or public land shall be punished by the Land Revenue
Office with a fine of One Thousand Rupees to Ten Thousand Rupees, and
such a land shall be made barren.
