submits false details with mala fide intention in connection with the
functions and proceedings of the Land Revenue Office pursuant to
Prevailing Law, such person shall be punished by the Land Revenue Office
with a fine upto One Thousand Rupees while deciding such matter.', 1, 'Land Revenue Act, 2034 (1978), Chapter -8, Section 28 (Punishment to a Person who Causes Obstruction and Hindrance)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
