32A.49Departmental Action: If it appears that actions to be carried out by the
Land Revenue Office pursuant to this Act have been carried out in a mala
fide manner, departmental action shall be taken against the concerned
Officer or employee.
32B.50 Power to void acts and actions: If it is learnt, by a petition of anyone or
