landowner and that person shall be evicted from the land if that person
is a tenant.', 1, 'The Lands Act, 2021(1964), Chapter-11, Section 59 (Powers of Government of Nepal to give direction regarding)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:Chapter-11.2', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:12', 2, 'section', '60', 'Notice to be given to Village Development Committee or', 'Notice to be given to Village Development Committee or', 'Municipality:
While lending or borrowing a loan in cash in a sum exceeding Rs. 50/-(Fifty
Rupees) or in-kind worth in excess of Rs. 50/- (Fifty Rupees) for any
agricultural acts, a notice thereof shall be given to the Village Development
Committee or Municipality.
Provided that, such committee or authority or cooperative bank or
cooperative institution as prescribed pursuant to this Act need not give such
notice while lending a loan.', 2, 'The Lands Act, 2021(1964), Chapter-11, Section 60 (Notice to be given to Village Development Committee or)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:Chapter-11.3', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:12', 2, 'section', '61', 'Powers to frame rules:', 'Powers to frame rules', 'Government of Nepal may frame Rules in order to accomplish the objective
of this Act.', 3, 'The Lands Act, 2021(1964), Chapter-11, Section 61 (Powers to frame rules)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:Chapter-11.4', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:12', 2, 'section', '62', 'Powers to remove difficulties:', 'Powers to remove difficulties', '(1) If there arises any difficulty in connection with the implementation of
this Act, Government of Nepal may, by a Notification in the Nepal
Gazette and subject to the ambit of this Act, issue necessary order;
and such order shall be deemed to be included in this Act.
(2) A copy of every order issued under Sub-section (1) shall be tabled in
the session of the Legislature- Parliament121 where the session is
going on for the time being within one week and in the coming
session where the session is in recess within one week.
121 Amended by the Republic Strengthening and Some Nepal Laws Amendment Act, 2066
www.lawcommission.gov.np 63
www.lawcommission.gov.np', 4, 'The Lands Act, 2021(1964), Chapter-11, Section 62 (Powers to remove difficulties)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:Chapter-11.5', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:12', 2, 'section', '63', 'Action in case of conflict:', 'Action in case of conflict', 'The matters contained in this Act and the Rules framed hereunder shall be
governed by this Act and Rules accordingly; and the other matters shall be
governed by the prevailing Nepal law.', 5, 'The Lands Act, 2021(1964), Chapter-11, Section 63 (Action in case of conflict)', '2026-01-15T09:00:00.000Z'),
  ('doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:Chapter-11.6', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf', 'doc_the_lands_act_2021_1964_2021_landact1964_pdf:12', 2, 'section', '64', 'Repeal:', 'Repeal', 'The following Nepal laws are hereby repealed:
(1) Maintaining the Records of Lands and Land Tillers Act, 2013(1965);
(2) The Lands Act, 2014(1957), Amendments made thereto from time to
time, and the Lands Rules, 2017(1960), and
(3) Agriculture (New Management) Act, 2019(1962).
